DESCRIPTION:Grade 12 PE / Health Period 3\n\n12年级体育/健康课第3
 节：第二单元（Block 2）开始。活动选项：羽毛球或足球
 （场地游戏）。请穿着合适的运动服和运动鞋。如果未
 选第二单元，请明智利用时间。\n\n公告原文：\nGrade 12 PE
  / Health Period 3 Hello class. Wanted to remind you that BLOCK 2 will be 
 starting on Monday Oct 19th. Badminton or Soccer - Field Games Make sure y
 ou come changed and ready with proper footwear for both Block Options. If 
 you are not in a Block 2\, please use your time wisely. ATTENTION: Also th
 ere was several of you that did NOT show up for your last class of BLOCK 1
 . Information will be shared based on the teacher that was running it. It 
 could be a make up day or 2 or even a full block needed if you were not in
  attendance enough. Thx Mr. D
LAST-MODIFIED:20261016T173305Z
